# Knowledge Base Privacy (Do not leak user note graphs!)
kb/raw/*.md
kb/wiki/*.md
kb/wiki/concepts/*.md
kb/wiki/synthesis/*.md
kb/wiki/log.md
kb/_index/*
kb/reports/*
kb/queries-*

# Explicitly keep the folder layout for Git clones
!kb/raw/.gitkeep
!kb/wiki/.gitkeep
!kb/wiki/concepts/.gitkeep
!kb/wiki/synthesis/.gitkeep
!kb/reports/.gitkeep
!kb/_index/.gitkeep

